The final run passed all 43 interfaces, 17 external hashes/uses, supplier order, role/domain boundaries, B leaves, anchors and page caps; exact rational/small binary-complex fixtures check amplitude damping, transpose flip, Pauli response sign, reversible jump stationarity and centered transport coefficients. check-result.json carries the actual command/result. This is a bounded structural/algebra check, not a proof certificate, renderer run, engine gate or empirical certification.

There are no unresolved required prerequisites of the asserted scoped interfaces. Stronger generic microscopic Markov/kinetic limits, arbitrary unbounded infinite Lindblad classification, general noncommuting Spohn/DPI, unrestricted quantum hydrodynamic limits and generic temporal dc integrability are expressly unasserted; no consumer uses them. The infinite-spin branch uses the actually constructed finite-range automorphism group and an explicit invariant-state hypothesis, without assuming a global trace Hamiltonian or temporal decay from spatial Lieb–Robinson bounds. Former dossiers and originals/imports were left read-only.

Final consumer integration receipt: particle_scaffold confirmed actual full reading of T0–T6/C0–C5/G0–G5, repaired sections/G4, and the frozen CSM D14 joint-path proof. The coordinator's canonical check passed 139 items (112 A,27 B),14 pairs,58 external suppliers, including exact DAG/home/class/B-leaf/cap/source and integrator-read hash checks. No remaining required repair was reported. This43-interface worker branch is frozen for the handoff; it remains a research dossier, not production publication.
